      "id": "claim_d0a1ab1e118a4bb4b0a9a8739713c030",
      "statement": "`ComparisonPageBuilder` is library-only by design: it is re-exported through `manifold.eval` but not registered in `[project.scripts]` of `pyproject.toml`, and the only shipped console surface for evaluation is `manifold-eval = \"manifold.eval.cli:main\"`. It assembles a self-contained HTML report (PNG slice grids embedded as base64 data URIs, no external scripts/stylesheets) from the eval run's `metrics.json`, slice-grid PNGs, and optional JiT training `metrics.csv` files.",
