    {
      "id": "claim_27fe96879e804e8aafff53c69ae33cbd",
      "statement": "The in-training monitor runs on every DDP rank redundantly: the fixed paired validation subset, the seeded noise (`torch.Generator().manual_seed(seed)`), and DDP-synchronized weights mean identical per-rank results, so the only cross-rank interaction is Lightning's torchmetrics sync on the `MeanMetric`; there is no FID-style sharding or `all_reduce` beyond the standard sync (collective-count invariance, ADR-0030, holds trivially). The 2-rank harness verifies identical logged + pre-sync local `val/psnr` / `val/ssim`, that the checkpoint monitor stays `val/x0_mae`, and that `is_global_zero` still writes the monitored checkpoint.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/metrics/paired_callback.py#L172-L217",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8a5fe6a011d00b9e64fe6c4b3492118be10ac54fae4796a2389098205a7e61b4:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/metrics/paired_callback.py#L23-L29",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3e7c7688fcd2f28912637b79783261e29304e7c74ad0c043e706ce0f72ddaa3e:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://tests/test_paired_fidelity_ddp.py#L19-L70",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bb1a558ae1294084763ac1a15733c0dc9035300d5a32efe9a6fbb4cd3506d73c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ae91cd2f0d384d2cb5089b59955d8531",
      "statement": "`min_max_to_unit` is the shared per-volume min-max-to-`[0,1]` helper for every decoded target latent in this project — it is consumed by `BeforeAfterEval._decode_normalize` for both the unconditional JiT and the paired ControlNet paths, by `ControlNetLatentFlowPipeline` for its published-output decode, and by `PairedFidelityCallback` for the in-training monitor's decoded target/real volumes — so the in-training curve and the offline before/after number are computed on identically-normalized inputs (`data_range = 1.0`) and stay directly comparable.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/adr/0036-controlnet-fidelity-offline-3d-psnr-ssim.md#L33-L37",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:19398c789c06167352a3d6f28368a89de52618a696968a9e2b397e69ccb993f6:"
