    {
      "id": "claim_0c431f3e70a443589d1751d8d3ae3157",
      "statement": "Extending the in-training paired-fidelity monitor to the ControlNet-GRPO path is a deliberate, separate follow-up: the blanket `forbidden_callbacks={\"fid\": ...}` on the ControlNet-GRPO path forbids unconditional FID because it ignores the ControlNet (a \"constant frozen-base metric\"), but paired fidelity rolls the trainable ControlNet via `controlnet_rollout`, so that rationale does not apply, and the follow-up must release the ban for `paired_fidelity` specifically without re-enabling unconditional FID on the ControlNet-GRPO path.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/adr/0036-controlnet-fidelity-offline-3d-psnr-ssim.md#L43-L47",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0beb9241468a5c83fd88158d8dfa9e61f839f9457729eaa9bfdd2db4b8a0c303:"
